ent-OrganXenoBase = xenomorph gland
    .desc = A wet gland cut from a xenomorph. It is silent in a hand or a pocket: a surgeon has to graft it into a body. A foreign body will take no more than two.
ent-OrganXenoRest = xenomorph rest gland
    .desc = A slow gland. The owner can lie down and knit itself back together.
ent-OrganXenoTail = xenomorph tail gland
    .desc = The muscle that drives a tail stab.
ent-OrganXenoTailHeavy = xenomorph heavy tail gland
    .desc = A thicker tail gland. The stab hits harder.
ent-OrganXenoTailQueen = xenomorph royal tail gland
    .desc = The queen's tail. It does not miss gently.
ent-OrganXenoAcidWeak = xenomorph weak acid gland
    .desc = A small acid sac. Enough for a weak glob.
ent-OrganXenoAcidSpit = xenomorph acid spit gland
    .desc = Acid, and the reflex to spit it.
ent-OrganXenoSpitter = xenomorph spitter gland
    .desc = A swollen acid sac with a heavy spit behind it.
ent-OrganXenoBoiler = xenomorph boiler gland
    .desc = Acid under pressure. The spit is slow and heavy.
ent-OrganXenoPraetorianAcid = xenomorph praetorian acid gland
    .desc = A soldier's acid sac. Spit, not a boiler's lob.
ent-OrganXenoAcid = xenomorph acid gland
    .desc = Corrosive acid, nothing else.
ent-OrganXenoWeeds = xenomorph weed gland
    .desc = Secretes a patch of hive weeds and nothing more ambitious.
ent-OrganXenoResin = xenomorph resin gland
    .desc = Weeds, walls, membranes, doors and sticky resin.
ent-OrganXenoResinFast = xenomorph fast resin gland
    .desc = A builder's full resin kit, including the quick secretion.
ent-OrganXenoPheromone = xenomorph pheromone gland
    .desc = A chemical shout the rest of the hive can feel.
ent-OrganXenoPheromoneTransfer = xenomorph plasma gland
    .desc = Pheromones, and the ability to push plasma into another xenomorph.
ent-OrganXenoScreech = xenomorph screech gland
    .desc = Pheromones and a screech that rattles the room.
ent-OrganXenoQueen = xenomorph royal gland
    .desc = Pheromones, screech, gut, zoom and plasma transfer.
ent-OrganXenoHide = xenomorph hide gland
    .desc = Lets the owner drop out of sight.
ent-OrganXenoLeap = xenomorph leap gland
    .desc = Hind-leg muscle for a long leap.
ent-OrganXenoPounce = xenomorph pounce gland
    .desc = A lurker's pounce.
ent-OrganXenoFortify = xenomorph carapace gland
    .desc = Locks the body into a fortified stance.
ent-OrganXenoWarrior = xenomorph warrior gland
    .desc = Punch, lunge and fling.
ent-OrganXenoStomp = xenomorph stomp gland
    .desc = A charge and a stomp.
ent-OrganXenoEgg = xenomorph ovipositor gland
    .desc = Grows an egg.

xeno-graft-examine = Silent in hand. Graft surgically: patient down → scalpel → Start surgery → open ribcage → Graft Xenomorph Gland (gland in hand) → cauterize. Two max. No plasma for people; hide and combat wait ~1 min.
xeno-graft-full = This body already carries two glands. A third will not take.
xeno-graft-xeno = A xenomorph grows its own glands. It will not take a harvested one.
xeno-graft-done = The gland takes.
xeno-graft-need-hand = Hold a xenomorph gland in your hand.
xeno-graft-insert-fail = The gland would not seat. Try again.
